{{!
    @template local_embeddiscussion/placeholder

    What the filter puts in place of an embedded discussion's token: the skeleton, in a container
    that the discussion JS module finds by data-region and fills with the live discussion.

    It never carries the token's attribute or key, so filtering the same text twice - as mod_lesson
    does - finds nothing to replace the second time.

    Classes required for JS:
    * filter-embeddiscussion

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="filter-embeddiscussion"
    * data-threadid
    * data-contextid

    Context variables required for this template:
    * uid (string)
    * threadid (int)
    * contextid (int)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "uid": "embeddisc_1234",
        "threadid": 7,
        "contextid": 42
    }
}}
<div class="filter-embeddiscussion" data-region="filter-embeddiscussion" id="{{uid}}" data-threadid="{{threadid}}" data-contextid="{{contextid}}">
  {{> local_embeddiscussion/skeleton }}
</div>
